{
  "id": "lunch-choice",
  "title": "午餐選餐",
  "titleEn": "Choosing School Lunch",
  "category": "飲食與校園",
  "level": "入門",
  "image": {
    "src": "/images/scenes/lunch-choice.webp",
    "alt": "在明亮的學校餐廳裡，小男孩端著餐盤排隊挑選午餐，櫃檯後方的廚工微笑為他盛上熱騰騰的飯菜與蔬菜。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo walks into the cafeteria and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "What's for ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "whats-for-lunch"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lunch",
          "phraseIds": [
            "whats-for-lunch"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "lunch"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "whats-for-lunch"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 走進學校餐廳，問道：「今天午餐吃什麼？」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He sees hot "
        },
        {
          "text": "chicken",
          "wordIds": [
            "chicken"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "It looks delicious.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "it-looks-delicious"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他看著熱騰騰的雞肉說：「看起來好好吃。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo says to the cook, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "I'd like some ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "id-like-some-rice-please"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rice",
          "phraseIds": [
            "id-like-some-rice-please"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "rice"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", please.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "id-like-some-rice-please"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 對廚工阿姨說：「我想要一些白飯，謝謝。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He chooses a fresh "
        },
        {
          "text": "vegetable",
          "wordIds": [
            "vegetable"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Can I have some ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "can-i-have-some-soup"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "soup",
          "phraseIds": [
            "can-i-have-some-soup"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "soup"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "can-i-have-some-soup"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他選了一道新鮮蔬菜，並問：「我可以要一些湯嗎？」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The cook smiles and puts the warm food on his "
        },
        {
          "text": "tray",
          "wordIds": [
            "tray"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "廚工阿姨微笑著，把熱騰騰的食物放到他的餐盤上。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo sits with his friends and happily enjoys his "
        },
        {
          "text": "lunch",
          "wordIds": [
            "lunch"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 和朋友們坐在一起，開心地享用他的午餐。"
    }
  ],
